Subject: [PATCH 45/64] arm64: dts: qcom: nabu: describe CS35L41 supplies

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-nabu.dts | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-nabu.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-nabu.dts
index e5613ccdcdf6..ea42ca0f13be 100644
